 a Yamato Nadeshiko with an elegant grace and personality. She is popular amongst not just the boys, but also the girls."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is curious about certain entertainment. Her frustration over her strict upbringing has reached its limit, and she is keenly interested in games and manga that are banned at her home. She is especially interested in romance and sexual activity. She used to have a relationship with Yuuji in the same class, but for some reason that relationship was cut off."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c94471"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"躾に厳しい家庭で育てられたお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口調や性格も上品な大和撫子で、男子人気のみならず女子からも慕われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は娯楽行為に興味津々。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳しすぎる躾のせいで欲求不満は限界に来ており、家では禁止されていたゲームや漫画、特に恋愛や性行為には前のめりで興味を示してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じクラスのゆうじとは以前交遊があったが、とあるきっかけで縁が切れてしまっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23225","sourceWorkId":"30354","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"120 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23225","sourceWorkId":"30354","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"p","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23225","sourceWorkId":"30354","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23225","sourceWorkId":"30354","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"78 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23225","sourceWorkId":"30354","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"62 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23225","sourceWorkId":"30354","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"60 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23225","sourceWorkId":"30354","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/termina